<title>SINGAPORE: UPP request for share suspension.</title>
<headline>UPP request for share suspension.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Pulp &amp; Paper Ltd on Thursday requested a suspension in the trading of its shares on Friday, November 8.</p>
<p>It said in a statement to the stock exchange that the suspension was pending an announcement by the company.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
